*[[Research]] Tanks:
**[[File:Tank_Pink.png|20px]] Pink Tank 4, bonus 2,
**[[File:Tank_Purple.png|20px]] Purple Tank 3, bonus 2,
**[[File:Tank_Blue.png|20px]] Blue Tank 1, bonus 2,
**[[File:Tank_Blood.png|20px]] Blood Tank 3, bonus 2.
*[[File:TPerk_BP.png|24px]] [[Train#Training_Perks|Training]] Perk no.11, 2% BP per level (up to 198%).
*[[File:InfPerk_05.png|24px]] [[Perks#Infinite_Perk_Tree|Infinity]] Perk, 1.5% BP per level (unlimited).
*[[File:Ap_rift.png|24px]] AP Rift Pro, unlocked through [[Construction]] (up to 226.9%).
*[[File:Contracts_icon.png|24px]] Each level of the second perk from Shop 4 in [[Contracts]] grants 3% extra BP when Rebirthing, up to 33% (+30% with[[File:DairyAisle_Contract.png|30px]][[Dairy Aisle|Perfectionist]]).
*Buy the Double BP bonus from the [[Gem Shop]] for 350 gems, adding 100% more BP per purchase, up to 5 times for a maximum bonus of 500%.



You can redeem [[File:Loot_BPCoupon.png|50px]] BP Coupons to immidiately receive BP as if you have Rebirthed, but without resetting the progress. They can be bought in [[Gem Shop]] or dropped in [[Asylum]] and [[Crypt]].

